"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for White County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, and in 2026 it came in at 36% on the middle of the grids. In 2025, November to December came in at 45% and August to September at 60% on the middle of the grids. Grid 21467 had its driest year in 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
